# Optional: force a specific local codesigning identity (common name, as
# shown by `security find-identity -v -p codesigning`) for seeding the
# unsigned archive with production entitlements before export. Defaults to
# the first "Apple Development" identity found, falling back to "Apple
# Distribution". See docs/cloudkit-sharing.md#deploysh-re-sign-dance-ios.
# DEPLOY_SEED_SIGN_IDENTITY=Apple Development: Your Name (XXXXXXXXXX)
